<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκτάομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>win</i> or <i>gain along with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκείνοις ἐφ᾽ ἃ ἦλθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.69
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.57
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χώραν ὅλην συγκτήσασθαι</span>
			<i>to have gained joint possession of</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1307a30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>get together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆν πολλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					26(14).24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>get at the same time</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἄλλας ἀρετάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.442
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
